&lt;li&gt;Strong customer focused service experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage in constructive dialogue, challenge concerns and maintain transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in problem-solving with limited direction and making confident decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
