&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a team responsible for service, support, and troubleshooting of automated processes and instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute or coordinate routine maintenance of laboratory equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform Installation, Operational, and Performance Qualification on equipment&lt;/li&gt;
