&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re driven by purpose, energized by innovation, and ready to help shape the future of precision medicine at scale, this is where you belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking exceptional entrepreneurial builders to join BillionToOne&#39;s newly launched &lt;strong&gt;Founder in Residence Program&lt;/strong&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Office of the CEO&lt;/strong&gt;. In this 12 to 18 month program, you will work directly with the CEO and Chief of Staff on the company&#39;s highest-priority strategic and operational projects, and graduate into a permanent senior operating role at the Director or Senior Director level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is one of the highest-leverage roles at BillionToOne. You will be deployed onto a portfolio of high-impact projects each quarter — from new product launches, to commercial strategy, to operational turnarounds, to incubating new business lines and capabilities. Your portfolio of 1-2 projects will be revisited each quarter so you are always working on what matters most to the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a first-principles thinker, a builder, AI-native, and exceptionally sharp. You have founded a company, operated at the most senior level of a top scaleup, or built a track record of high-impact strategic work, and you are looking for your next high-leverage seat — one that gives you scale, mission, and direct CEO exposure without starting from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
