&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find Broken Things and Fix Them:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify under-performing processes, workflows, or functions. Diagnose root cause, design the fix, and drive execution end-to-end with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
